all of which need to be addressed, Underlining that the strengthening of global cooperation and solidarity, including through multilateralism, is needed to facilitate fair access to AI technologies and address the challenges that they bring to diversity and interconnectivity of cultures and ethical systems, to mitigate potential misuse, to realize the full potential that AI can bring, especially in the area of development, and to ensure that national AI strategies are guided by ethical principles,","idx":20,"match_words":["far","convince","technology","bring","important","benefit","achieve","also","tension","innovation","asymmetric access","knowledge","technology","include","the digital and civic literacy deficit","limit","public","ability","engage","relate","well","access","information","gap","capacity","human","institutional","capacity","access","technological innovation","a lack","adequate physical and digital infrastructure","regulatory","framework","include","relate","datum","need","address","the strengthening","global cooperation","solidarity","include","need","facilitate","fair access","technology","address","challenge","bring","diversity","culture","ethical","system","mitigate","potential misuse","realize","the full potential","bring","especially","the area","development","ensure","national","strategy","guide","ethical","principle"],"words":["far","convince","that","ai","technology","can","bring","important","benefit","but","that","achieve","they","can","also","amplify","tension","around","innovation","asymmetric access","to","knowledge","and","technology","include","the digital and civic literacy deficit","that","limit","the","public","ability","to","engage","in","topic","relate","to","ai","as","well","as","barrier","to","access","to","information","and","gap","in","capacity","human","and","institutional","capacity","barrier","to","access","to","technological innovation","and","a lack","of","adequate physical and digital infrastructure","and","regulatory","