ientific understanding and explanation, and create a new basis for decision- making.Cultural identity and diversity, as AI technologies can enrich cultural and creative industries, but can also lead to an increased concentration of supply of cultural content, data, markets and income in the hands of only a few actors, with potential negative implications for the diversity and pluralism of languages, media, cultural expressions, participation and equality.Communication and information, as AI technologies play an increasingly important role in the processing,","idx":27,"match_words":["this recommendation","pay","specific attention","broad","ethical","implication","system","relation","central","domain","unesco","education","science","culture","communication","information","study","the ethics","artificial intelligence","the unesco world commission","ethics","scientific knowledge","technology","live","society","require","new","educational","practice","ethical reflection","critical thinking","responsible","design","practice","new","skill","give","implication","the labour market","civic participation","science","broad","sense","include","academic","field","natural","science","science","social","science","humanity","technology","bring","new","research","capacity","approach","have","implication","scientific understanding","create","a new basis","decision- making","cultural identity","diversity","technology","cultural","creative","industry","also","lead","increase","supply","cultural content","datum","market","only","actor","potential","negative","implication","the diversity","language","medium","cultural","expression","participation","equality","communication","information","technology","play","an increasingly important role","the processing"],"words":["this recommendation","pay","specific attention","to","the","broad","ethical","implication","of","ai","system","in","relation","to","the","central","domain","of","unesco","education","science","culture","and","communication","