","be"],["taken","VERB","take"],["to","PART",""],["mitigate","VERB",""],["risks","NOUN","risk"],null,["an","DET","an"],["essential","ADJ",""],["requirement","NOUN",""],["for","ADP",""],["trustworthiness","NOUN",""],["is","AUX","be"],["that","SCONJ",""],null,["throughout","ADP",""],["their","PRON",""],["life","NOUN",""],["cycle","NOUN",""],null,["ai","PROPN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["are","AUX","be"],["subject","ADJ",""],["to","ADP",""],["thorough","ADJ",""],["monitoring","NOUN",""],["by","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["relevant","ADJ",""],["stakeholders","NOUN","stakeholder"],["as","ADP",""],["appropriate","ADJ",""],null,["as","SCONJ","as"],["trustworthiness","NOUN",""],["is","AUX","be"],["an","DET",""],["outcome","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["operationalization","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["principles","NOUN","principle"],["in","ADP",""],["this","DET",""],["document","NOUN",""],null,["the","DET",""],["policy","NOUN",""],["actions","NOUN","action"],["proposed","VERB","propose"],["in","ADP",""],["this","DET",""],["recommendation","PROPN",""],["are","AUX","be"],["all","PRON",""],["directed","VERB","direct"],["at","ADP",""],["promoting","VERB","promote"],["trustworthiness","NOUN",""],["in","ADP",""],["all","DET",""],["stages","NOUN","stage"],["of","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["system","NOUN",""],["life","NOUN",""],["cycle","NOUN",""],null],"text":"The trustworthiness and integrity of the life cycle of AI systems is essential to ensure that AI technologies will work for the good of humanity, individuals, societies and the environment and ecosystems, and embody the values and principles set out in this Recommendation.People should have good reason to trust that AI systems can bring individual and shared benefits, while adequate measures are taken to mitigate risks.An essential requirement for trustworthiness is that, throughout their life cycle, AI systems are subject to thorough monitoring by the relevant stakeholders as appropriate.As trustworthiness is an outcome of the operationalization of the principles in this document, the policy actions proposed in this Recommendation are all directed at promoting trustworthiness in all stages of the AI system life cycle.","idx":38,"match_words":["the trustworthiness","integrity","the life cycle","system","essential","ensure","technology","work","the good","humanity","individual","society","the environment","ecosystem","value","principle","set","this recommendation","people","have","good reason","trust","system","bring","individual","shared","benefit","adequate","measure","take","mitigate","risk","an essential requirement","trustworthiness","their life cycle","system","subject","thorough monitoring","relevant","stakeholder","appropriate","trustworthiness","an outcome","the operationalization","principle","this document","policy","action","this recommendation","direct","promote","trustworthiness","stage","the ai system life cycle"],"words":["the trustworthiness","and","integrity","of","the life cycle","of","ai","system","be","essential","to","ensure","that","ai","technology","will","work","for","the good","of","humanity","individual","society","and","the environment","and","ecosystem","and","embody","the","value","and","principle","set","out","in","this recommendation","people","should","have","good reason","to","trust","that","ai","system","can","bring","individual","and","shared","benefit","while","adequate","measure","be","take","to","mitigate","risk","an essential requirement","for","trustworthiness","be","that","throughout","their life cycle","ai","system","be","subject","to","thorough monitoring","by","the","relevant","stakeholder","as","appropriate","as","trustworthiness","be","an outcome","of","the operationalization","of","the","principle","in","this document","the","policy","action","propose","in","this recommendation","be","all","direct","at","promote","trustworthiness","in","all","stage","of","the ai system life cycle"],"unm