""],["environment","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["ecosystems","NOUN","ecosystem"],null,["the","DET",""],["implementation","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["procedures","NOUN","procedure"],["for","ADP",""],["risk","NOUN",""],["assessment","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["the","DET",""],["adoption","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["measures","NOUN","measure"],["in","ADP",""],["order","NOUN",""],["to","PART",""],["preclude","VERB",""],["the","DET",""],["occurrence","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["such","ADJ",""],["harm","NOUN",""],["should","AUX",""],["be","AUX",""],["ensured","VERB","ensure"],null],"text":"It should be recognized that AI technologies do not necessarily, per se, ensure human and environmental and ecosystem flourishing.Furthermore, none of the processes related to the AI system life cycle shall exceed what is necessary to achieve legitimate aims or objectives and should be appropriate to the context.In the event of possible occurrence of any harm to human beings, human rights and fundamental freedoms, communities and society at large or the environment and ecosystems, the implementation of procedures for risk assessment and the adoption of measures in order to preclude the occurrence of such harm should be ensured.","idx":57,"match_words":["recognize","technology","ensure","human","environmental","ecosystem","furthermore","process","relate","the ai system life cycle","necessary","achieve","legitimate","aim","objective","appropriate","the context","the event","possible occurrence","any harm","human","being","human","right","fundamental","freedom","community","society","large or the environment","ecosystem","the implementation","risk assessment","the adoption","measure","order","the occurrence","such harm","ensure"],"words":["it","should","be","recognize","that","ai","technology","do","not","necessarily","ensure","human","and","environmental","and","ecosystem","flourish","furthermore","none","of","the","process","relate","to","the ai system life cycle","shall","exceed