"],["appropriate","ADJ",""],["to","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["context","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["should","AUX",""],["be","AUX",""],["based","VERB","base"],["on","ADP",""],["rigorous","ADJ",""],["scientific","ADJ",""],["foundations","NOUN","foundation"],null,["in","ADP","in"],["scenarios","NOUN","scenario"],["where","SCONJ",""],["decisions","NOUN","decision"],["are","AUX","be"],["understood","VERB","understand"],["to","PART",""],["have","VERB",""],["an","DET",""],["impact","NOUN",""],["that","PRON",""],["is","AUX","be"],["irreversible","ADJ",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["difficult","ADJ",""],["to","PART",""],["reverse","VERB",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["may","AUX",""],["involve","VERB",""],["life","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["death","NOUN",""],["decisions","NOUN","decision"],null,["final","ADJ",""],["human","ADJ",""],["determination","NOUN",""],["should","AUX",""],["apply","VERB",""],null,["in","ADP","in"],["particular","ADJ",""],null,["ai","PROPN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["should","AUX",""],["not","PART",""],["be","AUX",""],["used","VERB","use"],["for","ADP",""],["social","ADJ",""],["scoring","NOUN",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["mass","NOUN",""],["surveillance","NOUN",""],["purposes","NOUN","purpose"],null],"text":"The choice to use AI systems and which AI method to use should be justified in the following ways:  the AI method chosen should be appropriate and proportional to achieve a given legitimate aim;the AI method chosen should not infringe upon the foundational values captured in this document, in particular, its use must not violate or abuse human rights; and (c) the AI method should be appropriate to the context and should be based on rigorous scientific foundations.In scenarios where decisions are understood to have an impact that is irreversible or difficult to reverse or may involve life and death decisions, final human determination should apply.In particular, AI systems should not be used for social scoring or mass surveillance purposes.","idx":58,"ma