ocio-technical lens, greater transparency contributes to more peaceful, just, democratic and inclusive societies.It allows for public scrutiny that can decrease corruption and discrimination, and can also help detect and prevent negative impacts on human rights.Transparency aims at providing appropriate information to the respective addressees to enable their understanding and foster trust.Specific to the AI system, transparency can enable people to understand how each stage of an AI system is put in place, appropriate to the context and sensitivity of the AI system.It may also include insight into factors that affect a specific prediction or decision, and whether or not appropriate assurances (such as safety or fairness measures) are in place.In cases of serious threats of adverse human rights impacts, transparency may also require the sharing of code or datasets.","idx":76,"match_words":["socio","technical","great","transparency","contribute","more","peaceful","just","inclusive","society","allow","public scrutiny","discrimination","also","help","prevent","negative","impact","human","right","transparency","aim","provide","appropriate information","respective","enable","their understanding","foster trust","specific","the ai system","transparency","enable","people","understand","each stage","an ai system","put","place","appropriate","the context","the ai system","also","include","factor","affect","a specific prediction","decision","appropriate","such","safety","fairness","measure","place","case","threat","human","right","impact","transparency","also","require","the sharing","code","dataset"],"words":["from","a","socio","technical","len","great","transparency","contribute","to","more","peaceful","just","democratic","and","inclusive","society","it","allow","for","public scrutiny","that","can","decrease","corruption","and","discrimination","and","can","also","help","detect","and","prevent","negative","impact","on","human","right","transparency","aim","at","provide","appropriate information","to","the","respective","addressee","to","enable","their understanding","and","foster trust","specific","to","the ai system","transparency","can","enable","people","to","understand","how","each stage","of","an ai system","be","put","in","place","appropriate","to","the context","and","sensitivity","of","the ai system","it","may","also","include","insight","into","factor","that","affect","a specific prediction","or","decision","and","whether","or","not","appropriate","assurance","such","as","safety","or","fairness","measure","be","in","place","in","case","of","serious","threat","of","adverse","human","right","impact","transparency","may","also","require","the sharing","of","code","or","dataset"],"unmatched_count":58,"match_length":64,"cut_length":122},{"key":"78","text_words":[["explainability","NOUN","explainability"],["refers","VERB","refer"],["to","ADP",""],["making","VERB","make"],["intelligible","ADJ",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["providing","VERB","provide"],["insight","NOUN",""],["into","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["outcome","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],null,["the","DET","the"],["explainability","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["also","ADV",""],["refers","VERB","refer"],["to","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["understandability","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["input","NOUN",""],null,["output","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["the","DET",""],["functioning","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["each","DET",""],["algorithmic","ADJ",""],["building","NOUN",""],["block","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["how","SCONJ",""],["it","PRON",""],["contributes","VERB","contribute"],["to","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["outcome","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],null,["thus","ADV","thus"],null,["explainability","NOUN",""],["is","AUX","be"],["closely","ADV",""],["related","VERB","relate"],["to","ADP",""],["transparency","NOUN",""],null,["as","SCONJ",""],["outcomes","NOUN","outcome"],["and","CCONJ",""],["sub","NOUN",""],null,["processes","NOUN","process"],["leading","VERB","lead"],["to","ADP",""],["outcomes","NOUN","outcome"],["should","AUX",""],["aim","VERB",""],["to","PART",""],["be","AUX",""],["understandable","ADJ",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["traceable","ADJ",""],null,["appropriate","ADJ",""],["to","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["context","NOUN",""],null,["ai","PROPN",""],["actors","NOUN","actor"],["should","AUX",""],["commit","VERB",""],["to","ADP",""],["ensuring","VERB","ensure"],["that","SCONJ",""],["the","DET",""],["algorithms","NOUN","algorithm"],["developed","VERB","develop"],["are","AUX","be"],["explainable","ADJ",""],null,["in","ADP","in"],["the","DET",""],["case","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["applications","NOUN","application"],["that","PRON",""],["impact","VERB",""],["the","DET",""],["end","NOUN",""],["user","NOUN",""],["in","ADP",""],["a","DET",""],["way","NOUN",""],["that","PRON",""],["is","AUX","be"],["not","PART",""],["temporary","ADJ",""],null,["easily","ADV",""],["reversible","ADJ",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["otherwise","ADV",""],["low","ADJ",""],["risk","NOUN",""],null,["it","PRON",""],["should","AUX",""],["be","AUX",""],["ensured","VERB","ensure"],["that","SCONJ",""],["the","DET",""],["meaningful","ADJ",""],["explanation","NOUN",""],["is","AUX","be"],["provided","VERB","provide"],["with","ADP",""],["any","DET",""],["decision","NOUN",""],["that","PRON",""],["resulted","VERB","result"],["in","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["action","NOUN",""],["taken","VERB","take"],["in","ADP",""],["order","NOUN",""],["for","SCONJ",""],["the","DET",""],["outcome","NOUN",""],["to","PART",""],["be","AUX",""],["considered","VERB","consider"],["transparent","ADJ",""],null],"text":"Explainability refers to making intelligible and providing insight into the outcome of AI systems.The explainability of AI systems also refers to the understandability of the input, output and the functioning of each algorithmic building block and how it contributes to the outcome of the systems.Thus, explainability is closely related to transparency, as outcomes and sub-processes leading to outcomes should aim to be understandable and traceable, appropriate to the context.AI actors should commit to ensuring that the algorithms developed are explainable.In the case of AI applications that impact the end user in a way that is not temporary, easily reversible or otherwise low risk, it should be ensured that the meaningful explanation is provided with any decision that resulted in the action taken in order for the outcome to be considered transparent.","idx":77,"match_words":["explainability","refer","make","provide","the outcome","system","the explainability","system","also","refer","the understandability","the input","the functioning","each algorithmic building block","contribute","the outcome","system","thus","explainability","relate","transparency","outcome","process","lead","outcome","aim","appropriate","the context","actor","ensure","algorithm","develop","the case","application","impact","the end user","a way","easily","otherwise","risk","ensure","the meaningful explanation","provide","any decision","result","the action","take","order","the outcome","consider","transparent"],"words":["explainability","refer","to","make","intelligible","and","provide","insight","into","the outcome","of","ai","system","the explainability","of","ai","system","also","refer","to","the understandability","of","the input","output","and","the functioning","of","each algorithmic building block","and","how","it","contribute","to","the outcome","of","the","system","thus","explainability","be","closely","relate","to","transparency","as","outcome","and","sub","process","lead","to","outcome","should","aim","to","be","understandable","and","traceable","appropriate","to","the context","ai","actor","should","commit","to","ensure","that","the","algorithm","develop","be","explainable","in","the case","of","ai","application","that","impact","the end user","in","a way","that","be","not","temporary","easily","reversible","or","otherwise","low","risk","it","should","be","ensure","that","the meaningful explanation","be","provide","with","any decision","that","result","in","the action","take","in","order","for","the outcome","to","be","consider","transparent"],"unmatched_count":66,"match_length":51,"cut_length":117},{"key":"79","text_words":[["transparency","NOUN","transparency"],["and","CCONJ",""],["explainability","NOUN",""],["relate","VERB",""],["closely","ADV",""],["to","PART",""],["adequate","ADJ",""],["responsibility","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["accountability","NOUN",""],["measures","NOUN","measure"],null,["as","ADV",""],["well","ADV",""],["as","ADP",""],["to","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["trustworthiness","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],null],"text":"Transparency and explainability relate closely to adequate responsibility and accountability measures, as well as to the trustworthiness of AI systems.","idx":78,"match_words":["transparency","explainability","relate","adequate","responsibility","accountability","measure","well","the trustworthiness","system"],"words":["transparency","and","explainability","relate","closely","to","adequate","responsibility","and","accountability","measure","as","well","as","to","the trustworthiness","of","ai","system"],"unmatched_count":9,"match_length":10,"cut_length":19},{"key":"80","text_words":[["responsibility","NOUN","responsibility"],["and","CCONJ",""],["accountability","NOUN",""]],"text":"Responsibility and accountability","idx":79,"match_words":["responsibility","accountability"],"words":["responsibility","and","accountability"],"unmatched_count":1,"match_length":2,"cut_length":3},{"key":"81","text_words":[["ai","PROPN",""],["actors","NOUN","actor"],["and","CCONJ",""],["member","PROPN",""],["states","PROPN",""],["should","AUX",""],["respect","VERB",""],null,["protect","VERB",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["pro