],["the","DET",""],["life","NOUN",""],["cycle","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["system","NOUN",""],null],"text":"AI actors and Member States should respect, protect and promote human rights and fundamental freedoms, and should also promote the protection of the environment and ecosystems, assuming their respective ethical and legal responsibility, in accordance with national and international law, in particular Member States’ human rights obligations, and ethical guidance throughout the life cycle of AI systems, including with respect to AI actors within their effective territory and control.The ethical responsibility and liability for the decisions and actions based in any way on an AI system should always ultimately be attributable to AI actors corresponding to their role in the life cycle of the AI system.","idx":80,"match_words":["actor","member states","respect","protect","promote","human","right","fundamental","freedom","also","promote","the protection","the environment","ecosystem","their respective ethical and legal responsibility","accordance","national and international law","particular","member","states","human","right","obligation","ethical guidance","the life cycle","system","include","respect","actor","their effective territory","control","the ethical responsibility","liability","decision","action","base","any way","an ai system","always","actor","their role","the life cycle","the ai system"],"words":["ai","actor","and","member states","should","respect","protect","and","promote","human","right","and","fundamental","freedom","and","should","also","promote","the protection","of","the environment","and","ecosystem","assume","their respective ethical and legal responsibility","in","accordance","with","national and international law","in","particular","member","states","’","human","right","obligation","and","ethical guidance","throughout","the life cycle","of","ai","system","include","with","respect","to","ai","actor","within