nisms, including whistle-blowers’ protection, should be developed to ensure accountability for AI systems and their impact throughout their life cycle.Both technical and institutional designs should ensure auditability and traceability of (the working of) AI systems in particular to address any conflicts with human rights norms and standards and threats to environmental and ecosystem well-being.","idx":81,"match_words":["appropriate oversight","impact assessment","due","diligence","mechanism","include","protection","develop","ensure","accountability","system","their impact","their life cycle","technical","institutional","design","ensure","auditability","traceability","the working","system","particular","address","human","right","norm","standard","threat","environmental","ecosystem","well","being"],"words":["appropriate oversight","impact assessment","audit","and","due","diligence","mechanism","include","whistle","blower","protection","should","be","develop","to","ensure","accountability","for","ai","system","and","their impact","throughout","their life cycle","both","technical","and","institutional","design","should","ensure","auditability","and","traceability","of","the working","of","ai","system","in","particular","to","address","any","conflict","with","human","right","norm","and","standard","and","threat","to","environmental","and","ecosystem","well","being"],"unmatched_count":27,"match_length":32,"cut_length":59},{"key":"83","text_words":[["awareness","NOUN","awareness"],["and","CCONJ",""],["literacy","NOUN",""]],"text":"Awareness and literacy","idx":82,"match_words":["awareness","literacy"],"words":["awareness","and","literacy"],"unmatched_count":1,"match_length":2,"cut_length":3},{"key":"84","text_words":[["public","ADJ","public"],["awareness","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["understanding","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["technologies","NOUN","technology"],["and","CCONJ",""],["the","DET",""],["value","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["data","NOUN","dat