tergovernmental organizations, civil society, academia, the media, community leaders and the private sector, and considering the existing linguistic, social and cultural diversity, to ensure effective public participation so that all members of society can take informed decisions about their use of AI systems and be protected from undue influence.","idx":83,"match_words":["public awareness","understanding","technology","the value","datum","promote","open and accessible education","civic engagement","digital","skill","ethic","training","medium","information literacy","training","lead","government","intergovernmental","organization","civil society","academia","medium","community","the private sector","consider","exist","social","cultural","diversity","ensure","effective public participation","member","society","take","informed","decision","their use","system","protect","undue influence"],"words":["public awareness","and","understanding","of","ai","technology","and","the value","of","datum","should","be","promote","through","open and accessible education","civic engagement","digital","skill","and","ai","ethic","training","medium","and","information literacy","and","training","lead","jointly","by","government","intergovernmental","organization","civil society","academia","the","medium","community","leader","and","the private sector","and","consider","the","exist","linguistic","social","and","cultural","diversity","to","ensure","effective public participation","so","that","all","member","of","society","can","take","informed","decision","about","their use","of","ai","system","and","be","protect","from","undue influence"],"unmatched_count":33,"match_length":40,"cut_length":73},{"key":"85","text_words":[["learning","VERB","learn"],["about","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["impact","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["should","AUX",""],["include","VERB",""],["learning","VERB","learn"],["about","ADP",""],null,["through","ADP",""],["and","CCONJ