circumstances","NOUN","circumstance"],["and","CCONJ",""],["priorities","NOUN","priority"],["of","ADP",""],["each","DET",""],["member","PROPN",""],["state","PROPN",""],null,["unesco","PROPN",""],["can","AUX",""],["be","AUX",""],["a","DET",""],["partner","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["support","VERB",""],["member","PROPN",""],["states","PROPN",""],["in","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["development","NOUN",""],["as","ADV",""],["well","ADV",""],["as","ADP",""],["monitoring","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["evaluation","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["policy","NOUN",""],["mechanisms","NOUN","mechanism"],null],"text":"The policy actions described in the following policy areas operationalize the values and principles set out in this Recommendation.The main action is for Member States to put in place effective measures, including, for example, policy frameworks or mechanisms, and to ensure that other stakeholders, such as private sector companies, academic and research institutions, and civil society adhere to them by, among other actions, encouraging all stakeholders to develop human rights, rule of law, democracy, and ethical impact assessment and due diligence tools in line with guidance including the United Nations Guiding Principles on Business and Human Rights.The process for developing such policies or mechanisms should be inclusive of all stakeholders and should take into account the circumstances and priorities of each Member State.UNESCO can be a partner and support Member States in the development as well as monitoring and evaluation of policy mechanisms.","idx":88,"match_words":["policy","action","follow","policy","area","value","principle","set","this recommendation","the main action","member states","put","place","effective","measure","include","example","policy","framework","mechanism","ensure","other","stakeholder","such","private","sector","company","academic","research","institution","civil society","other","action","encourage","stakeholder","develop","human","rig