l],"text":"Member States should put in place mechanisms to require AI actors to disclose and combat any kind of stereotyping in the outcomes of AI systems and data, whether by design or by negligence, and to ensure that training data sets for AI systems do not foster cultural, economic or social inequalities, prejudice, the spreading of disinformation and misinformation, and disruption of freedom of expression and access to information.Particular attention should be given to regions where the data are scarce.","idx":106,"match_words":["member states","put","place","mechanism","require","actor","any kind","outcome","system","datum","design","ensure","training","datum","set","system","foster","cultural","economic","social","inequality","prejudice","the spreading","disinformation","misinformation","freedom","expression","access","information","particular attention","give","datum"],"words":["member states","should","put","in","place","mechanism","to","require","ai","actor","to","disclose","and","combat","any kind","of","stereotype","in","the","outcome","of","ai","system","and","datum","whether","by","design","or","by","negligence","and","to","ensure","that","training","datum","set","for","ai","system","do","not","foster","cultural","economic","or","social","inequality","prejudice","the spreading","of","disinformation","and","misinformation","and","disruption","of","freedom","of","expression","and","access","to","information","particular attention","should","be","give","to","region","where","the","datum","be","scarce"],"unmatched_count":44,"match_length":32,"cut_length":76},{"key":"108","text_words":[["member","PROPN",""],["states","PROPN",""],["should","AUX",""],["implement","VERB",""],["policies","NOUN","policy"],["to","PART",""],["promote","VERB",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["increase","VERB",""],["diversity","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["inclusiveness","NOUN",""],["that","PRON",""],["reflect","VERB",""],["their","PRON",""],["populationsin","NOUN",""],["ai","PROPN",""],[