r","ADJ",""],["characteristics","NOUN","characteristic"],null],"text":"Member States should establish their data policies or equivalent frameworks, or reinforce existing ones, to ensure full security for personal data and sensitive data, which, if disclosed, may cause exceptional damage, injury or hardship to individuals.Examples include data relating to offences, criminal proceedings and convictions, and related security measures; biometric, genetic and health data; and -personal data such as that relating to race, colour, descent, gender, age, language, religion, political opinion, national origin, ethnic origin, social origin, economic or social condition of birth, or disability and any other characteristics.","idx":114,"match_words":["member states","establish","data","policy","framework","reinforce","exist","ensure","full security","personal","datum","sensitive","datum","cause","exceptional damage","individual","example","include","datum","relate","related","security","measure","health","datum","datum","such","relate","race","colour","descent","gender","age","language","religion","political","opinion","national","origin","ethnic","origin","social","origin","economic","social","condition","birth","disability","other","characteristic"],"words":["member states","should","establish","their","data","policy","or","equivalent","framework","or","reinforce","exist","one","to","ensure","full security","for","personal","datum","and","sensitive","datum","which","if","disclose","may","cause","exceptional damage","injury","or","hardship","to","individual","example","include","datum","relate","to","offence","criminal","proceeding","and","conviction","and","related","security","measure","biometric","genetic","and","health","datum","and","-personal","datum","such","as","that","relate","to","race","colour","descent","gender","age","language","religion","political","opinion","national","origin","ethnic","origin","social","origin","economic","or","social","condition","of","birth",