raditional forms of education are vital in teacher-student and student-student relationships and should be considered when discussing the adoption of AI technologies in education.AI systems used in learning should be subject to strict requirements when it comes to the monitoring, assessment of abilities, or prediction of the learners’ behaviours.AI should support the learning process without reducing cognitive abilities and without extracting sensitive information, in compliance with relevant personal data protection standards.The data handed over to acquire knowledge collected during the learner’s interactions with the AI system must not be subject to misuse, misappropriation or criminal exploitation, including for commercial purposes.","idx":144,"match_words":["member states","encourage","research","initiative","the responsible and ethical use","technology","teacher training","learning","other","issue","enhance","opportunity","mitigate","challenge","risk","involve","this area","initiative","an adequate assessment","the quality","education","impact","student","teacher","the use","technology","member states","also","ensure","technology","student","teacher","enhance","their experience","bear","mind","social","aspect","the value","form","education","teacher","student","student","student","relationship","consider","the adoption","technology","education","system","use","learning","subject","requirement","the monitoring","assessment","ability","prediction","behaviour","support","the learning process","reduce","cognitive","ability","sensitive information","compliance","relevant","personal","datum","protection","standard","datum","knowledge","collect","interaction","the ai system","subject","misuse","criminal exploitation","include","purpose"],"words":["member states","should","encourage","research","initiative","on","the responsible and ethical use","of","ai","technology","in","teaching","teacher training","and","e","learning","among","other","issue","to","enhance","oppor