o ensure a fair transition for at-risk employees.This includes putting in place upskilling and reskilling programmes, finding effective mechanisms of retaining employees during those transition periods, and exploring “safety net” programmes for those who cannot be retrained.Member States should develop and implement programmes to research and address the challenges identified that could include upskilling and reskilling, enhanced social protection, proactive industry policies and interventions, tax benefits, new taxation forms, among others.Member States should ensure that there is sufficient public funding to support these programmes.Relevant regulations, such as tax regimes, should be carefully examined and changed if needed to counteract the consequences of unemployment caused by AI-based automation.","idx":158,"match_words":["member states","work","private","sector","company","civil","society","organization","other","stakeholder","include","worker","ensure","a fair transition","risk","include","put","place","reskille","programme","find","effective","mechanism","safety","programme","member states","develop","implement","programme","research","address","challenge","identify","include","reskille","enhance","social","protection","industry","policy","intervention","benefit","new","form","other","member states","ensure","sufficient public funding","support","programme","relevant","regulation","such","change","need","consequence","cause","base"],"words":["member states","should","work","with","private","sector","company","civil","society","organization","and","other","stakeholder","include","worker","and","union","to","ensure","a fair transition","for","at","risk","employee","this","include","put","in","place","upskille","and","reskille","programme","find","effective","mechanism","of","retain","employee","during","those","transition","period","and","explore","safety","net","programme","for","those","who","can","not","be","retrain","member states","should","develop","an