d mitigate bias; ensuring that the professional, the patient, caregiver or service user is included as a “domain expert” in the team in all relevant steps when developing the algorithms; paying due attention to privacy because of the potential need for being medically monitored and ensuring that all relevant national and international data protection requirements are met; ensuring effective mechanisms so that those whose personal data is being analysed are aware of and provide informed consent for the use and analysis of their data, without preventing access to healthcare; ensuring the human care and final decision of diagnosis and treatment are taken always by humans while acknowledging that AI systems can also assist in their work; ensuring, where necessary, the review of AI systems by an ethical research committee prior to clinical use.","idx":163,"match_words":["member states","pay","particular attention","regulate","prediction","treatment","solution","health care","application","ensure","oversight","mitigate","bias","ensure","professional","the patient","service user","include","domain","the team","relevant","step","develop","algorithm","pay","due attention","privacy","the potential need","monitor","ensure","relevant","national","international","datum","protection","requirement","ensure","effective","mechanism","personal","datum","provide","informed consent","the use","analysis","datum","prevent","access","ensure","the human care","final decision","treatment","take","always","human","system","also","assist","their work","ensure","necessary","the review","system","an ethical research committee","clinical use"],"words":["member states","should","pay","particular attention","in","regulate","prediction","detection","and","treatment","solution","for","health care","in","ai","application","by","ensure","oversight","to","minimize","and","mitigate","bias","ensure","that","the","professional","the patient","caregiver","or","service user","be","include","as","a","domain"