assistance of AI technologies should be applied to increase the safety and ergonomic use of robots, including in a human-robot working environment.Special attention should be paid to the possibility of using AI to manipulate and abuse human cognitive biases.","idx":165,"match_words":["member states","develop","guideline","robot","interaction","their impact","human","human","relationship","base","research","direct","the future development","robot","special attention","the mental and physical health","human","being","particular attention","give","the use","robot","health care","the care","person","person","disability","education","robot","use","child","robot","robot","child","furthermore","assistance","technology","apply","increase","the safety","ergonomic use","robot","include","human","robot","working","environment","special attention","pay","the possibility","use","abuse","human","cognitive","bias"],"words":["member states","should","develop","guideline","for","robot","interaction","and","their impact","on","human","human","relationship","base","on","research","and","direct","at","the future development","of","robot","and","with","special attention","to","the mental and physical health","of","human","being","particular attention","should","be","give","to","the use","of","robot","in","health care","and","the care","for","old","person","and","person","with","disability","in","education","and","robot","for","use","by","child","toy","robot","chatbot","and","companion","robot","for","child","and","adult","furthermore","assistance","of","ai","technology","should","be","apply","to","increase","the safety","and","ergonomic use","of","robot","include","in","a","human","robot","working","environment","special attention","should","be","pay","to","the possibility","of","use","ai","to","manipulate","and","abuse","human","cognitive","bias"],"unmatched_count":50,"match_length":55,"cut_length":105},{"key":"167","text_words":[["member","PROPN",""],["states","PROPN",""],["should","A